adf196.avif?t=1745636733\" width=600 height=122 /></span>Navigate the story of <strong>Our Red String</strong> by leveling four main stats: <strong>Wits</strong>, <strong>Charisma</strong>, <strong>Athleticism</strong>, and <strong>LUST</strong>! Each unlocks their own set of dialogue options to choose from. Along the way, you must acquire <strong>Money </strong>and <strong>Will </strong>to spend on the things your heart truly desires.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DUAL PROTAGONISTS:</strong> The story unfolds, alternating between Lena &amp; Ian's viewpoint!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY CHOICE MATTERS:</strong>\u00a0Complex, branching paths with an emphasis on player freedom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KINK FRIENDLY:</strong> Walk on the wild side and engage in NTR, BDSM, exhibitionism, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669040/extras/7a72d861287ee3e47069e0338536de4b.avif?t=1745636733\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p>",
